{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0003": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$p$", "MATH_0005": "$p' : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0006": "$p' : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}/U$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cute-groupoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:84c15068985e13a93461cb6c1666136fd00f32f8c1b9c7e72d3b24c78ded570a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:345ca99e5b7c26592df3ac316bd229f174c3dec61ba8e5145f3923c4c7e4a57c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. Let <MATH_0002>.\nIf <MATH_0003> is a category fibred in groupoids\nand <MATH_0004> factors through <MATH_0005>\nthen <MATH_0006> is fibred in groupoids.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ce5c3cbb918e81fdf6b708d71b0c49fbcbff49a1347735efd1811921ec2b4119", "unit_id": "tag:02XT:statement"}
